tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/114dac0d3b30e9c55a2f3eaf65311940.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought about going to the moon to play with a pogo stick?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/6f6d18ae753bdbf298ea4caf54e9592c.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/6f6d18ae753bdbf298ea4caf54e9592c.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/6f6d18ae753bdbf298ea4caf54e9592c.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/2ca8e47606b332eec697d22bbe9937d5.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/2ca8e47606b332eec697d22bbe9937d5.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/2ca8e47606b332eec697d22bbe9937d5.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operation of the game is very simple.    Move the character left and right, press the space bar in the air, charge down, release before landing, the faster the impact on the ground, the higher the bounce height, and let yourself fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/b6656541b1d2014cb98a4591c001c8c0.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/b6656541b1d2014cb98a4591c001c8c0.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/b6656541b1d2014cb98a4591c001c8c0.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine that you are on the edge of a cliff with a howling snowstorm, but you are stepping on a pogo stick, trying to take off with the help of the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exciting game that can make you unconsciously tense up your legs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emotions will be like the spring of a bouncy bar, repeatedly experiencing extreme suppression and release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/bfc209b34252fa123f3851b5af3543ae.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/bfc209b34252fa123f3851b5af3543ae.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/bfc209b34252fa123f3851b5af3543ae.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared with the predecessors of such games, falling is a powerless despair.    But in this game, if you can seize the opportunity, you can make up for operational mistakes.    If you don't have time to be sad, you won't be sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it's not just frustration, but also survival after a disaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the NPC's stressful &quot;encouragement&quot;, bravely climb upwards and show the world your &quot;ugly&quot; appearance of bravely reaching the peak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/54d415bdc006ec568844bfc04af7a04d.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/54d415bdc006ec568844bfc04af7a04d.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/54d415bdc006ec568844bfc04af7a04d.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the level design full of &quot;kindness&quot;, and more hidden elements await your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold coins to unlock the NPC's codex, but note that you need to deposit the gold coins into the ATM to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/7610250ff318238bf973f875011f461a.avif?t=1758508898\" data-has-big width=800 height=654 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pokedex unlocking system has been designed as a card-drawing system, which might give you some &quot;motivation&quot; to pass the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f693c63fdf88a81f26d4d9c379fd30a0.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=240 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f693c63fdf88a81f26d4d9c379fd30a0.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/f693c63fdf88a81f26d4d9c379fd30a0.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to complete the collection of all the picture albums will be a very hard challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the falling speed in the game exceeds a threshold, &quot;gold coin explosion&quot; will be triggered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/c387918673a5c5cef14ec1cb3e73412c.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/c387918673a5c5cef14ec1cb3e73412c.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/c387918673a5c5cef14ec1cb3e73412c.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to collect enough gold coins, you need to choose to carry them forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that time, what you might lose after a single fall is kinetic energy, but perhaps all the efforts you made before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this extreme thrill of ups and downs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the very beginning, you will think this game is very difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you get started, you will find that it is indeed very difficult</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But difficulties are ultimately limited.    People's hearts are always accustomed to magnifying unknown difficulties into infinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you live a happy and joyful life, you can try this game.    Maybe it can double your happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are at a low point, you can also try this game, because I also made this game during a low period</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or if you're just bored, you can also give this game a try.    It took you more than half a year to make it on a whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e11a13730d612c4cdfe3455131718be5.poster.avif?t=1758508898\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e11a13730d612c4cdfe3455131718be5.webm?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/extras/e11a13730d612c4cdfe3455131718be5.mp4?t=1758508898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are all naive when facing the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the face of the universe, ideals seem insignificant</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bro Z is like a knight charging towards the windmill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go all out for a fantastical goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who are proficient in Newtonian mechanics might be able to calculate how high a pogo stick can jump on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But bro Z didn't want to calculate.    He just wanted to go up and experience it himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once truly arriving, fantasy is no longer fantasy but a real hope</p>","developers":["liangzixiaoqiang"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600940/d550206845b370ff24ad50eef028afb105dbe3e3/hea